---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - China Starter Guide" lang="en">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700  ">
      <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> June 1, 2026</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>This site is a static website. We do not collect, store, or process any personal information from visitors. We do not use cookies for tracking purposes.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">2. Analytics</h2>
      <p>We may use privacy-friendly analytics (such as Umami or GoatCounter) that do not collect personal data and do not use cookies. No personal information is tracked or stored.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">3. External Links</h2>
      <p>This site contains links to external websites (such as Alipay, WeChat, or booking platforms). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">4. Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at: <a href="mailto:contact@chinastarterguide.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">contact@chinastarterguide.com</a></p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200  " />

      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">This privacy policy is kept intentionally simple because we do not collect your data.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>